        "attribution": "Moodera and Miyazaki made decisive observations, with Parkin central to development toward robust devices.",
        "maturity": "The effect is exceptionally well established and technologically consequential.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Its relation to the already recognized giant-magnetoresistance field and the contribution of earlier tunnelling work require careful boundary setting."
